WEBVTT

00:00:51.180 --> 00:00:53.770
What's wrong? You look depressed, Nene.

00:00:54.510 --> 00:00:56.780
What? Nothing's wrong.

00:00:56.780 --> 00:00:59.490
You look like you're unusually
lost in your own thoughts.

00:00:59.490 --> 00:01:03.480
Oh, no. You make it sound like
I'm an airhead all the time.

00:01:04.890 --> 00:01:06.480
Why don't you go to lunch with us?

00:01:07.490 --> 00:01:10.830
Say, Leon, how's Priss doing lately?

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:14.370
Is there any progress in your relationship?

00:01:14.370 --> 00:01:18.470
Not at all. She acts like she's
dating someone else these days.

00:01:18.470 --> 00:01:21.880
She doesn't care about him, right?

00:01:21.880 --> 00:01:26.180
Hey, you don't need to say that! I...

00:01:26.180 --> 00:01:29.210
I see. Priss is working hard, I guess.

00:01:30.220 --> 00:01:33.780
It's nothing! Nothing at all!

00:01:34.450 --> 00:01:37.750
Working hard on a man?

00:02:00.310 --> 00:02:01.380
Sylia...

00:02:01.380 --> 00:02:02.870
Priss, it's ready.

00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:06.590
Here I go.

00:02:13.390 --> 00:02:15.060
This isn't the one, I guess.

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:17.460
Damn, not here either?

00:02:18.300 --> 00:02:21.670
Priss, sorry, but please go to the next site.

00:02:21.670 --> 00:02:22.830
Okay.

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:26.710
Sylia, I'm here.

00:02:27.340 --> 00:02:29.100
Okay, please check the area.

00:02:31.280 --> 00:02:32.840
There seems to be no response.

00:02:34.850 --> 00:02:37.250
I'm going to move to the next site, Sylia.

00:02:37.250 --> 00:02:38.720
Roger.

00:02:40.790 --> 00:02:42.280
Six points left...

00:02:48.360 --> 00:02:49.830
Where are you?

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:03.670
Sylia? Sylia!

00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:07.950
Sorry, Linna, are you already there?

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:10.610
I just came to a dead end. Can
I check the site from here?

00:03:11.320 --> 00:03:15.190
It's more than 300 meters away.
The sonar won't reach the area.

00:03:15.190 --> 00:03:16.590
Is there any other route?

00:03:17.120 --> 00:03:20.890
Wait a second. I'm going
to check around there.

00:03:20.890 --> 00:03:22.860
I guess you don't need to.

00:03:22.860 --> 00:03:24.330
Priss?

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:28.300
Found it!

00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:30.670
Priss, thank you. Please withdraw and return.

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:33.840
I'll be back after checking around here.

00:03:34.910 --> 00:03:36.380
Okay.

00:03:57.360 --> 00:04:00.130
It looks like this place used to be a highway.

00:04:05.110 --> 00:04:07.800
The corner of a building has
been stuck in the road.

00:04:22.660 --> 00:04:24.760
Sylia, this is a hallway of the building.

00:04:24.760 --> 00:04:26.230
Priss!

00:04:26.790 --> 00:04:27.860
I'm going in.

00:04:27.860 --> 00:04:30.190
No! Priss, come back!

00:04:32.230 --> 00:04:33.700
Priss!

00:04:43.110 --> 00:04:46.080
Wow, pretty good feeling, isn't it?

00:04:46.080 --> 00:04:48.310
Priss, this place is not a hot spring.

00:04:48.310 --> 00:04:49.780
Who cares.

00:04:51.280 --> 00:04:52.790
Shall we go now?

00:04:52.790 --> 00:04:56.190
Anyway, I'm impressed that you listened to Sylia.

00:04:57.090 --> 00:04:59.430
I would have expected you to go on by yourself.

00:04:59.430 --> 00:05:02.230
If the battery hadn't been out, I would have.

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:04.360
I thought you only cared about
whether you get paid or not.

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:08.360
I was in front of the target
after a five day search!

00:05:10.140 --> 00:05:14.070
I wonder how dangerous the
thing buried in there is?

00:05:14.610 --> 00:05:16.400
You care about it too.

00:05:18.850 --> 00:05:20.400
Sylia was pretty desperate, wasn't she?

00:05:21.180 --> 00:05:23.780
To stop you, Priss.

00:05:24.450 --> 00:05:25.690
What's the matter? I'm already here!

00:05:25.690 --> 00:05:27.290
Stop, Priss!

00:05:27.290 --> 00:05:28.790
I just want to go in and check.

00:05:28.790 --> 00:05:30.260
I said come back!

00:05:34.330 --> 00:05:35.790
Priss!

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:41.990
My battery is out. I'll be right back.

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:50.280
I'm really relieved. Finally,
I'll be able to have it out.

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:52.310
What are you talking about, Sylia?

00:05:52.310 --> 00:05:55.610
You aren't going to do something
about it yourself, are you?

00:05:56.520 --> 00:05:59.690
Sorry, but from now on this is my own business.

00:05:59.690 --> 00:06:01.220
You're kidding me.

00:06:01.220 --> 00:06:03.880
After leading us by the nose,
what are you saying now?

00:06:04.520 --> 00:06:07.820
Priss is right, Sylia. You made Nene mad and...

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:12.600
I understand. I will ask you to help me.

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:15.000
I'll let you know when it's ready.

00:06:15.970 --> 00:06:19.700
Thank you very much. Please
come and visit us again.

00:06:20.510 --> 00:06:22.540
It's not too bad an experience to
spend time at the beauty salon.

00:06:22.540 --> 00:06:26.240
See? I didn't think you'd been
to a place like this.

00:06:26.810 --> 00:06:29.820
You felt like you were at some hot
spring resort in a jacuzzi, right?

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:31.340
Is something wrong with that?

00:06:34.150 --> 00:06:35.850
That's not like you, is it?

00:06:38.020 --> 00:06:40.420
I wonder how Nene is doing?

00:06:44.160 --> 00:06:45.630
Finally, I'm entering the home stretch.

00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:54.040
The question is, where can
I get the power from?

00:06:58.580 --> 00:07:00.170
Is there an active line left?

00:07:02.780 --> 00:07:06.450
Here? This place used the old
line before the earthquake.

00:07:07.220 --> 00:07:10.680
If I can connect the power from
this factory, I can do it!

00:07:20.130 --> 00:07:22.070
Sylia? Sylia?

00:07:25.910 --> 00:07:27.210
Sylia...

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:31.510
Mr. Mackey, Lady Sylia is not here.

00:07:33.150 --> 00:07:35.910
Is she out? Sylia, that is?

00:07:36.580 --> 00:07:39.350
She didn't tell me anything.

00:07:39.950 --> 00:07:41.920
Excuse me, Mr. Meisio.

00:07:41.920 --> 00:07:43.320
What's the matter?

00:07:44.190 --> 00:07:48.060
Sylia's been out every night. I wonder
what she's been doing?

00:07:48.700 --> 00:07:51.630
Well, I don't know what she's doing.

00:07:55.340 --> 00:07:56.800
Hiding from me.

00:07:57.700 --> 00:07:59.170
Mr. Mackey?

00:08:00.140 --> 00:08:04.200
She's cared about you this entire time.

00:08:05.650 --> 00:08:08.280
If you understand that,

00:08:08.280 --> 00:08:11.750
I think that you'd be doing her
a big favor by saying nothing

00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:13.620
and accepting her reasoning.

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:16.250
That's not it.

00:08:16.790 --> 00:08:18.320
What is it?

00:08:18.320 --> 00:08:20.450
I don't know why, but my body feels strange.

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:25.330
As if someone were calling me.

00:08:59.730 --> 00:09:02.740
This is for you from Dr. Shan.

00:09:02.740 --> 00:09:04.670
Thank you very much.

00:09:08.810 --> 00:09:11.840
Please be careful when handling this.

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:15.010
Please give him my sincere appreciation.

00:09:35.940 --> 00:09:37.200
It's me.

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:40.330
They're on the move. I'll send
you a picture right now.

00:09:43.880 --> 00:09:45.480
Stand by.

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:46.950
Yes, Sir.

00:09:48.010 --> 00:09:49.610
In broad daylight?

00:09:55.590 --> 00:09:58.520
Cancel my schedule for this afternoon.

00:09:58.520 --> 00:09:59.890
As you wish.

00:10:01.630 --> 00:10:04.290
Do you also want to have the letter "e"?

00:10:27.790 --> 00:10:33.280
You guys, stay at the underground
highway and wait for Mr. Mason.

00:10:45.070 --> 00:10:46.540
This is Murakami.

00:10:47.210 --> 00:10:48.980
Standing by, okay.

00:10:48.980 --> 00:10:49.640
Go ahead.

00:10:49.640 --> 00:10:50.480
Detonate!
Go ahead.

00:10:50.480 --> 00:10:51.100
Detonate!

00:11:05.630 --> 00:11:08.190
Oh, I'm so hungry.

00:11:09.200 --> 00:11:11.720
Hey, Megu. Megu!

00:11:14.900 --> 00:11:16.740
What is it? Lunch?

00:11:16.740 --> 00:11:18.270
What shall we eat?

00:11:18.270 --> 00:11:22.340
Aren't you a little bit early?
We have another thirty minutes!

00:11:22.340 --> 00:11:24.810
But I'm hungry.

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:27.500
See, you have a call.

00:11:28.280 --> 00:11:30.120
Hello, this is the AD Police.

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:32.850
An explosion at the underground highway?

00:11:32.850 --> 00:11:35.660
Location is in the Outside Ward,
at the edge of the South Area.

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:36.460
Units 7 and 18, explosion on the
underground highway inbound,

00:11:36.460 --> 00:11:38.790
There has been an explosion on
the underground highway,
Units 7 and 18, explosion on the
underground highway inbound,

00:11:38.790 --> 00:11:39.030
South Area in Outside Ward,
near the Shin-lsobe exit.
Units 7 and 18, explosion on the
underground highway inbound,

00:11:39.030 --> 00:11:42.430
South Area in Outside Ward,
near the Shin-lsobe exit.
150 meters before the Shin-lsobe exit.

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:43.460
This is Unit 7, roger.

00:11:43.460 --> 00:11:44.700
This is Unit 18, roger.

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:46.600
What? There are some saboteurs
and armored boomers?

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:47.730
There has been an explosion on the
underground highway inbound,
What? There are some saboteurs
and armored boomers?

00:11:47.730 --> 00:11:48.730
There has been an explosion on the
underground highway inbound,

00:11:48.730 --> 00:11:53.670
South Area in Outside Ward,
near the Shin-lsobe exit.

00:11:53.670 --> 00:11:57.010
The Wiz Lab is in the current
South Area, within five kilometers.

00:12:00.180 --> 00:12:05.950
This is Miles. Regarding this
incident, we will wait and see.

00:12:05.950 --> 00:12:06.050
Standby and await further orders.

00:12:06.050 --> 00:12:07.450
Chief?!
Standby and await further orders.

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:12.020
Dispatched vehicles should return
to the station immediately. Over.

00:12:12.020 --> 00:12:13.530
What the hell is going on?!

00:12:13.530 --> 00:12:15.330
What's going on, Chief?!

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:17.660
This was decided by top management.

00:12:49.500 --> 00:12:50.800
Hello, this is Yamazaki.

00:12:50.800 --> 00:12:53.530
Sylia seems to have gone to the lab by herself!

00:12:53.530 --> 00:12:54.870
Nene?!

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:58.270
Heavily armed agents from
Genom are chasing her.

00:12:58.270 --> 00:12:59.470
What do you mean?

00:12:59.470 --> 00:13:02.510
Go to the front door. Priss is on
her way to pick you up.

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:04.030
Roger. I'll be right there!

00:13:10.250 --> 00:13:11.320
Linna!

00:13:11.320 --> 00:13:12.720
You shouldn't change clothes
in such an urgent situation.

00:13:12.720 --> 00:13:15.090
I can't ride a bike with my skirt on, can I?

00:13:15.090 --> 00:13:16.550
Don't fall.

00:13:26.330 --> 00:13:27.800
What smoke!

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:34.460
Which security camera is at the highway?

00:13:35.070 --> 00:13:37.880
Not here. Not this one.

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:39.540
Oh, here it is!

00:13:40.350 --> 00:13:41.810
Sylia...

00:13:57.800 --> 00:13:58.100
Sylia!

00:13:58.100 --> 00:13:59.300
Sylia!
Sylia!

00:13:59.300 --> 00:13:59.560
Sylia!

00:14:00.630 --> 00:14:01.270
Nene!

00:14:01.270 --> 00:14:02.130
I can't find her anywhere!
Nene!

00:14:02.130 --> 00:14:02.970
I can't find her anywhere!

00:14:02.970 --> 00:14:05.460
No mobile pit, no hard suits, they're all gone!

00:14:06.440 --> 00:14:09.670
Sylia intended to go by herself
from the very beginning!

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:13.550
That's why she said okay to us that time.

00:14:13.550 --> 00:14:15.950
Anyway, let's hurry up. Genom is chasing her!

00:14:22.960 --> 00:14:24.120
This way, Sir.

00:14:24.120 --> 00:14:25.090
You put on a showy act.

00:14:25.090 --> 00:14:25.630
Yes, Sir.
You put on a showy act.

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:26.560
Yes, Sir.

00:14:29.430 --> 00:14:30.860
Please wait for me,

00:14:32.130 --> 00:14:34.690
my dear princess.

00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:48.310
I've returned, finally.

00:15:34.430 --> 00:15:36.490
Now I have an energy supply.

00:15:39.100 --> 00:15:40.570
The only thing I need is time.

00:16:02.290 --> 00:16:03.760
Guinea pig.

00:16:14.530 --> 00:16:17.400
Geez, I don't think I can go down there.

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:31.020
Won't open.

00:17:39.290 --> 00:17:40.980
Don't think badly of me.

00:17:44.490 --> 00:17:46.120
It's about time to say goodbye

00:17:46.990 --> 00:17:48.460
for eternity.

00:17:50.330 --> 00:17:52.090
That's it.

00:17:52.870 --> 00:17:54.700
Sylia Stingray.

00:17:54.700 --> 00:17:56.470
Mason!

00:17:56.470 --> 00:17:58.460
Thank you for guiding us.

00:17:59.440 --> 00:18:01.600
I won't let you have it.

00:18:02.440 --> 00:18:04.680
A microwave cannon?

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:07.610
You intend to destroy the contents
without unsealing it, don't you?

00:18:08.310 --> 00:18:09.980
However, seven years ago,

00:18:09.980 --> 00:18:13.180
she wasn't affected at all by
destructive power like that.

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:17.320
Sure, that was seven years ago.

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:18.790
What the hell?!

00:18:32.270 --> 00:18:34.360
It's powered by the electricity
generated by the Skyhook?!

00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:02.400
Sylia...

00:19:04.770 --> 00:19:06.840
Now the contents have been burned black.

00:19:06.840 --> 00:19:08.970
It's like a huge microwave, isn't it?

00:19:09.940 --> 00:19:11.470
How dare you?

00:19:12.280 --> 00:19:13.750
Mackey!

00:19:16.550 --> 00:19:18.180
Mackey Stingray...

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:21.080
You're attracted to each other just as I thought.

00:19:24.190 --> 00:19:26.950
Mackey, why are you here?

00:19:29.430 --> 00:19:31.000
I guess she's awake now.

00:19:31.000 --> 00:19:32.460
What the hell?!

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:34.600
Sylia!

00:19:34.600 --> 00:19:36.070
Sylia!

00:19:36.700 --> 00:19:37.940
Mackey...

00:19:37.940 --> 00:19:39.400
Mackey!

00:19:45.780 --> 00:19:47.250
Mackey!

00:19:51.220 --> 00:19:52.680
Look at the boomers!

00:20:02.160 --> 00:20:03.630
Come back!

00:20:04.600 --> 00:20:06.200
What the hell is this?!

00:20:06.200 --> 00:20:08.100
Nene!

00:20:08.100 --> 00:20:10.000
Priss, what's going on?

00:20:10.000 --> 00:20:12.440
My hard suit's not responding
well to commands.

00:20:13.370 --> 00:20:14.940
Mackey!

00:20:14.940 --> 00:20:17.840
Get out of there! Hurry up! Mackey!

00:20:26.420 --> 00:20:27.890
Mackey!

00:20:30.720 --> 00:20:32.190
Come with me.

00:20:37.830 --> 00:20:39.300
Mackey!

00:20:44.070 --> 00:20:45.540
Damn!

00:20:54.210 --> 00:20:55.680
Sotai!

00:20:56.340 --> 00:20:59.210
Next Episode

00:21:00.940 --> 00:21:02.710
In front of a screaming Sylia,

00:21:02.710 --> 00:21:05.450
the girl who is the origin of the
boomers walks away with Mason.

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:08.180
We abandoned our hard suits and evacuated,

00:21:08.180 --> 00:21:10.020
but now Sylia spends all her time daydreaming.

00:21:10.020 --> 00:21:14.680
As if cogwheels were broken,
something among us is changing.

00:21:15.320 --> 00:21:19.320
And finally, Nigel told us about Sylia's past.

00:21:19.900 --> 00:21:21.920
Next Bubblegum Crisis!
